{
  "info": {
    "name": "ICONZ 10 — Registration (production)",
    "_postman_id": "iconz10-registration-prod",
    "description": "**Set `key` before running anything.**\n\nSIMBA answers HTTP 200 to everything, refusals included, and puts the real verdict in `status_code`. Every test here asserts on that, not on the HTTP status — a green tick in Postman's status column means nothing on its own. `000` is success.\n\nEach run mints a fresh name, e-mail, phone and `spc_id`. That last one is not decoration: **spc_id has to be unique for every registration**, and a repeat is refused as \"Data exist or failed\" — the same sentence SIMBA returns for a bad key and for a missing column. A fixed value looked for weeks like an endpoint that had stopped accepting registrations.\n\n**The open question**, as of 2 September 2026: the same key is accepted by demo-simba (`000 Sukses`) and refused by production (`101 Key Invalid`). The two folders below are laid out so that can be shown side by side. The controls rule out the payload: production answers a deliberately wrong key exactly as it answers ours, and names the field itself when no key is sent at all.\n\nOther things worth knowing, all learned the hard way:\n\n- multipart, not urlencoded\n- `meta` is a list of `{meta, value}` pairs, and the five names must match the event's own definitions exactly, down to the lowercase b in \"Asal benua\"\n- `institusi` and `jenis` are free text, not ids — SIMBA accepts anything non-empty, so nothing on its side will tidy five spellings of one office\n- `tanggal_bayar` and `jumlah` must not be blank, even though the event is free\n- a straight apostrophe in any value is refused outright",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "simbaProd",
      "value": "https://simba.baznas.go.id/api/ajax_event_register_peserta"
    },
    {
      "key": "simbaDemo",
      "value": "https://demo-simba.baznas.or.id/api/ajax_event_register_peserta"
    },
    {
      "key": "siteUrl",
      "value": "https://iconz.baznas.go.id"
    },
    {
      "key": "key",
      "value": "",
      "description": "SIMBA API key. Paste it here."
    },
    {
      "key": "org",
      "value": "3171100"
    },
    {
      "key": "eventId",
      "value": "202",
      "description": "202 = the tenth ICONZ on production."
    },
    {
      "key": "eventDemo",
      "value": "128",
      "description": "The event this was built against, on demo."
    },
    {
      "key": "unique",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "spcId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
